cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Inspektorium, please cite the software using this metadata."
title: "Inspektorium"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-26
repository-code: "https://github.com/LAKITALKS/Inspektorium"
authors:
  - family-names: "Varvatis"
    given-names: "Lazaros"
abstract: >-
  Inspektorium is one instrument for evidence integrity and review in AI
  assurance research. Its official workflow, inspektorium audit, runs the
  Inspektorium audit runtime (internal/former name Agent Arena, retained in
  package, module and folder names for provenance). It also retains a smaller
  evidence-binding reference checker.
  Technical controls and recorded provenance do not establish scientific truth.
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - evidence binding
  - source grounding
  - citation validation
